   "jp": "{8001}{8605}{949B}「やられたよ・・・」{8300}{8605}{949B}「ソウチを作るのにヒツヨウなパーツが{8207}ゼンブなくなっている・・・」{8300}{8605}{949B}「{9409}め・・・」{8300}{8605}{949B}「こちらの動きを{8207}読んで先手をうったか・・・」{8400}{8100}",
   "en": "{8001}{8605}{949B}They got us...{8300}{8605}{949B}Every part we need to build the device is gone...{8300}{8605}{949B}Curse you, {9409}...{8300}{8605}{949B}So you read our moves and struck first...{8400}{8100}",
   "status": "translated"
  },
  {
   "id": "ev22B05E_020",
   "idx": [
    20
   ],
   "jp": "{8001}{8602}{9498}「ど、どうしよう～？？？」{8300}{8602}{9498}「{9403}ちゃんを助ける事は{8207}もう出来ないのかな～？」{8400}{8100}",
   "en": "{8001}{8602}{9498}Wh-What do we do~???{8300}{8602}{9498}Is there no way left to save {9403}~?{8400}{8100}",
   "status": "translated"
  },
  {
   "id": "ev22B05E_021",
   "idx": [
    21
   ],
   "jp": "{8001}{8602}{9497}「な、何バカな事言ってるのよ！{8207}・・・でも、一体どうしたら・・・？」{8400}{8100}",
   "en": "{8001}{8602}{9497}Wh-What kind of silly talk is that! ...But what on earth can we do...?{8400}{8100}",
   "status": "translated"
  },
  {
   "id": "ev22B05E_022",
   "idx": [
    22
   ],
   "jp": "{8001}{8602}{9497}「{9400}、どこ行くの？」{8300}{8602}{9497}「もしかして・・・{8207}子分をおいかけるの？」\n\n{8D00}{8100}",
   "en": "{8001}{8602}{9497}{9400}, where are you going?{8300}{8602}{9497}Could it be... you're going after the Grunt?{8D00}{8100}",
   "status": "translated"
  },
  {
   "id": "ev22B05E_023",
   "idx": [
    23
   ],
   "jp": "{8001}{8602}{9497}「・・・そうだね」{8300}{8602}{9497}「あきらめるのは{8207}まだ早いよね！」{8300}{8602}{9497}「子分もまだそう遠くへは{8207}行っていないはずだし・・・」{8300}{8602}{9497}「今すぐおいかければ{8207}きっとつかまえられるはずだよ！」{8300}{8602}{9497}「じゃあアタシ、先に行ってるね！」{8400}{8100}",
   "en": "{8001}{8602}{9497}...You're right.{8300}{8602}{9497}It's still too early to give up!{8300}{8602}{9497}The Grunt can't have gotten that far yet...{8300}{8602}{9497}If we chase after him right now, I bet we can catch him!{8300}{8602}{9497}Okay, I'll go on ahead!{8400}{8100}",
   "status": "translated"
  },
  {
   "id": "ev22B05E_024",
   "idx": [
    24
   ],
   "jp": "{8001}{8602}{9498}「ま、まってよ～！！{8207}オイラもいっしょに行くよ～！！！」{8400}{8100}",
   "en": "{8001}{8602}{9498}W-Wait for me~!! I'm coming with you~!!{8400}{8100}",
   "status": "translated"
